              "fill": "$text-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1000,
              "content": "The six-stage strip stays a reading of where the contract sits — except for one segment. The stage it is in now is also the button, so the act starts exactly where the eye already is, and the other five stages stay unpressable.",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "KhNFG",
