                  "name": "Cost text",
                  "fill": "$text-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 960,
                  "content": "The strip stops being purely a reading, so the one live segment has to carry an obvious affordance; the track grows from 28px to 32px to hold a raised chip, and the menu picks statuses while the segment it hangs from is labelled with a stage.",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
